{"audit_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002-correction-001:false-negative","completed_at":"2026-07-30T20:00:00+08:00","cycle_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002-correction-001","error_semantics":"routing_disagreement_v1","expansion_required":false,"expansion_symbols":{},"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"plan_sha256":"2a13f90685a443034684547e85484a6d487fc73c86d5dc511de8595010bc4ec1","policy":{"policy_id":"triage-quality-audit.default","sha256":"38aa9eb6ff0ac130e9b6e8c26ab54618455ac57540c9bab8a58ebd0bbe5c75f9","version":"1.0.0"},"portfolio_action":null,"redo_required":false,"redo_strata":[],"reopen_required":false,"reopen_symbols":[],"reviewed_count":2,"rows":[{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002-correction-001:false-negative:CN-000066","major_disagreement":false,"material_error":false,"original_disposition":"price_watch","recommended_disposition":"price_watch","review":{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002-correction-001:false-negative:CN-000066","decisive_question":"在不依赖城市更新回迁房产收益和政府补助的情况下，主营业务能否实现扣非盈利并把战略备货转化为持续正经营现金流，从而支撑当前约448亿元市值？","facts_packet_sha256":"d3129fe5832140dd2fa2e4d0e0e0b8d93c5a835dfd7eed4c837038b3ad7b45e5","findings":[{"category":"business_momentum","finding_id":"operating_improvement","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2025_annual_report","s1_2026_q1_report"],"statement":"主营经营出现真实改善：2025年营业收入同比增长11.31%，计算产业和系统装备收入分别增长11.25%和15.06%，毛利率分别提升0.84和3.31个百分点；2026年一季度收入同比增长约12.67%，归母亏损由1.60亿元收窄至0.84亿元。该变化值得持续跟踪，但尚不足以单独证明盈利拐点。"},{"category":"earnings_quality","finding_id":"nonrecurring_profit","severity":"major","source_ids":["s1_2025_annual_report","s1_2026_h1_forecast"],"statement":"利润质量仍弱：2025年归母亏损仅0.56亿元，但扣非归母亏损6.50亿元，5.94亿元非经常性收益主要来自资产处置和政府补助；2026年上半年虽预计归母盈利2.30亿至3.30亿元，扣非仍预计亏损2.80亿至4.20亿元，且预计非经常性损益6.10亿至6.50亿元，主要为城市更新回迁房产收益及政府补助。"},{"category":"cash_conversion_and_balance_sheet","finding_id":"cash_and_inventory","severity":"major","source_ids":["s1_2025_annual_report","s1_2026_q1_report"],"statement":"现金转化和营运资金压力尚未解除：2025年经营现金流净额由正1.82亿元转为负3.26亿元；2026年一季度进一步净流出6.40亿元，期末存货较年初增长44.50%至77.98亿元，同时长期借款由39.01亿元升至61.93亿元。"},{"category":"asset_quality","finding_id":"asset_quality","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2025_impairment","s1_2026_guarantees"],"statement":"2025年计提各类减值准备合计4.89亿元，其中存货跌价准备4.01亿元；此外，拟担保对象海盾光纤资产负债率91.23%、年度净亏损1.19亿元。虽然现有担保余额占归母净资产比例不高且无逾期，相关资产与子公司风险仍需折价。"},{"category":"valuation_and_price","finding_id":"valuation_watch","severity":"material","source_ids":["s1_2025_annual_report","s1_2026_q1_report","s2_sina_kline_20260729"],"statement":"按2026年一季度末32.26亿股及2026年7月29日13.89元计算，总市值约448亿元，约为2025年营业收入的2.8倍，而主营扣非仍亏损；股价又由7月9日20.00元收盘回落至7月29日13.89元，显示预期波动很大。经营改善与估值、盈利质量风险并存，更适合价格观察而非立即晋级。"}],"provenance":{"agent":"/root/quality2_000063/qualitycorr_000066","generated_at":"2026-07-30T19:50:04+08:00","model":"GPT-5","tools":["functions.exec","shell_command","pypdf","requests"]},"recommended_disposition":"price_watch","schema_version":1,"symbol":"CN:000066"},"symbol":"CN:000066"},{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002-correction-001:false-negative:CN-000061","major_disagreement":false,"material_error":false,"original_disposition":"price_watch","recommended_disposition":"price_watch","review":{"audit_item_id":"2026-07-30-all-a-continuous-triage-002-correction-001:false-negative:CN-000061","decisive_question":"未来两个季度剔除土地收储等一次性收益后的核心利润增长能否持续，同时参股公司债权逾期与减值风险是否停止扩张，并使前瞻ROE和估值回报改善到足以补偿资本占用的水平？","facts_packet_sha256":"a1ec9f1b596466ce96614337b6856df27ad2dcd634327dbffa07e571840b30d6","findings":[{"category":"earnings_quality_and_valuation","finding_id":"earnings-quality-valuation","severity":"minor","source_ids":["cninfo-2025-annual-1225214296","cninfo-2026-q1-1225214307","cninfo-wuhan-aid-1225418123","eastmoney-000061-20260729-close"],"statement":"公司拥有覆盖20余个城市、35个实体物流园的农批市场网络，经营现金流保持为正，2026年一季度扣非归母净利润同比增长21.68%，具备继续观察的经营基础；但2025年扣非归母净利润同比下降28.23%、加权ROE仅5.38%，一季度归母净利润80.89%的增幅又主要来自土地收储收益。按2026年7月29日5.88元收盘价和最新总股本估算，市值约116.7亿元，相当于2025年扣非利润约56倍，且武汉海吉星借款继续逾期，当前证据不足以支持直接晋级，保留价格观察更合适。"}],"provenance":{"agent":"/root/quality2_000063/qualitycorr_000061","generated_at":"2026-07-30T19:57:55+08:00","model":"gpt-5","tools":["shell_command"]},"recommended_disposition":"price_watch","schema_version":1,"symbol":"CN:000061"},"symbol":"CN:000061"}],"schema_version":1,"status":"passed","strata":[{"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.1,"next_sample_symbols":[],"observed_material_error_rate":0.0,"over_threshold":false,"population_count":0,"reviewed_count":0,"stratum":"catalog"},{"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.1,"next_sample_symbols":[],"observed_material_error_rate":0.0,"over_threshold":false,"population_count":5,"reviewed_count":2,"stratum":"price_watch"},{"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.0,"next_sample_symbols":[],"observed_material_error_rate":0.0,"over_threshold":false,"population_count":0,"reviewed_count":0,"stratum":"conditional_stop"},{"major_disagreement_count":0,"material_error_count":0,"material_error_rate_threshold":0.0,"next_sample_symbols":[],"observed_material_error_rate":0.0,"over_threshold":false,"population_count":0,"reviewed_count":0,"stratum":"reassign_or_stop"}],"subject_kind":"triage_false_negative"}